OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fturning more frequent and heavier
OL,7,Facross Moray and western Aberdeenshire
OL,8,Fduring the evening, otherwise
OL,9,Foutbreaks isolated with few reaching
OL,10,Feast coast. Southwest winds increasing
OL,11,Facross the coasts overnight.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FMost east of A9 dry with
OL,14,Fbest of the brighter spells appearing
OL,15,Fthrough the morning. Scattered showers
OL,16,Fto west of the A9, building in the far
OL,17,Fwest for the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
